--Description: 
-- Determine the pathname with the SECOND‑highest number of December‑2020
-- page‑views on shop.googlemerchandisestore.com.
-- 1. Scan every GA4 events table whose suffix is 202012* (all Dec‑2020 data).
-- 2. Keep only rows where event_name = 'page_view'.
-- 3. CROSS JOIN UNNEST(event_params) to expose each key/value pair, and keep the
--    element whose key = 'page_location' (this holds the full visited URL).
